<title>UK: Pasa sets $100 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Pasa sets $100 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PASA</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    01.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE  S-05.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD    +185-200 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX/BUENOS AIRES		   PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 50	  GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  30 BP</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE-YEAR U.S.T</p>
<p> NOTES	PASA IS 100 PCT OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF PEREZ COMPANC.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
